00:00:23.457 --> 00:00:26.994 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Depuis 1990, le nombre

00:00:24.658 --> 00:00:28.228 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de camions légers, comme les

00:00:25.859 --> 00:00:29.430 size:53% position:73% line:53%
