00:00:27.094 --> 00:00:30.664 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les camionnettes de type pick-

00:00:28.329 --> 00:00:31.865 size:53% position:73% line:53%
up, a pratiquement quadruplé

00:00:29.530 --> 00:00:33.100 size:53% position:73% line:53%
