00:01:07.534 --> 00:01:11.071 size:53% position:73% line:53%
CATHERINE MORENCY,

00:01:08.736 --> 00:01:12.339 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Polytechnique Montréal

00:01:09.970 --> 00:01:13.573 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- On a vraiment raté l'occasion

00:01:11.171 --> 00:01:14.808 size:53% position:73% line:53%
là... En rendant ces véhicules

00:01:12.439 --> 00:01:16.009 size:53% position:73% line:53%
